(1. SUBMISSION PRINCIPLES) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Documents establish identity, insured event, diagnosis, treatment, payment and amount.) Tj
T*
(Missing documents must be requested specifically.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-1.1  Minimum viable claim) Tj
T*
(   A claim requires member and policy identification, claimant contact, provider identity,) Tj
T*
(   admission and discharge dates, diagnosis or presenting condition, treatment description,) Tj
T*
(   claimed amount and claimant declaration.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-1.2  Originals and copies) Tj
T*
(   Legible digital copies may start assessment. Originals may be requested for) Tj
T*
(   reimbursement, coordination of benefits or suspected alteration where permitted. Receipt) Tj
T*
(   of an original must be logged.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-1.3  Alternative evidence) Tj
T*
(   Where a standard document is unavailable, equivalent reliable evidence may be accepted) Tj
T*
(   after documented review. The system must not reject solely because a file name or format) Tj
T*
(   differs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-1.4  Language and legibility) Tj
T*
(   Illegible, truncated, password-protected or untranslated material is PENDING_INFORMATION.) Tj
T*
(   It is not automatically false or fraudulent.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
