(2. UNIVERSAL REIMBURSEMENT CHECKLIST) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(The following items normally apply to in-patient reimbursement.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-2.1  Completed claim form) Tj
T*
(   Signed or authenticated form with member, treatment, bank and declaration fields.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-2.2  Member identity) Tj
T*
(   Health card or member certificate plus government-issued identity where required.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-2.3  Discharge summary) Tj
T*
(   Final diagnosis, history, treatment, procedures, condition at discharge and follow-up) Tj
T*
(   advice.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-2.4  Final hospital bill) Tj
T*
(   Numbered bill showing provider, patient, dates, total and taxes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-2.5  Detailed bill breakup) Tj
T*
(   Itemized room, professional, procedure, medicine, diagnostic, implant and other charges.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-2.6  Payment evidence) Tj
T*
(   Numbered receipts or acceptable digital payment proof for reimbursement claims.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-2.7  Prescriptions) Tj
T*
(   Signed prescriptions supporting medicines, investigations and follow-up treatment) Tj
T*
(   claimed.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-2.8  Diagnostic reports) Tj
T*
(   Reports that support diagnosis and medical necessity, not merely invoices.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-2.9  Bank evidence) Tj
T*
(   Cancelled cheque or verified bank details matching the authorized payee.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-2.10  KYC or tax documents) Tj
T*
(   Only when required by payment, identity or applicable compliance rules.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
