(3. CONDITIONAL DOCUMENT MATRIX) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Request only documents relevant to the event and reason for assessment.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-3.1  Accident) Tj
T*
(   Medico-legal record or police information when created, emergency notes, accident) Tj
T*
(   narrative, and alcohol/toxicology report only when clinically performed or materially) Tj
T*
(   relevant.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-3.2  Implant) Tj
T*
(   Implant sticker, batch or serial number, invoice and procurement record when an implant) Tj
T*
(   charge is claimed.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-3.3  Maternity) Tj
T*
(   Obstetric records, delivery notes, newborn record and birth evidence. Marriage proof is) Tj
T*
(   not a default medical claim requirement.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-3.4  Newborn) Tj
T*
(   Birth record, neonatal notes, enrollment request and relationship evidence.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-3.5  Organ transplant) Tj
T*
(   Authorization records, recipient and donor clinical records, donor bills and lawful) Tj
T*
(   transplant approval.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-3.6  Dialysis or chemotherapy) Tj
T*
(   Cycle plan, administration record, drug details, invoices and treating specialist advice.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-3.7  Day-care surgery) Tj
T*
(   Procedure note, anaesthesia record where applicable and discharge advice.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-3.8  AYUSH) Tj
T*
(   Facility recognition evidence, practitioner registration, case sheets, prescriptions and) Tj
T*
(   itemized bills.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-3.9  Domiciliary treatment) Tj
T*
(   Doctor certification explaining why hospital transfer was impossible or no bed was) Tj
T*
(   available, plus daily treatment charts.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-3.10  Other insurance) Tj
T*
(   Other insurer settlement letter, certified bill copies and deduction details when) Tj
T*
(   coordination is required.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-3.11  Death claim) Tj
T*
(   Death summary or certificate and lawful claimant authority where payment cannot be made) Tj
T*
(   to the member.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
