(4. CASHLESS PREAUTHORIZATION DOCUMENTS) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Cashless requests focus on eligibility and estimated treatment before final billing.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-4.1  Preauthorization request) Tj
T*
(   Network hospital request containing symptoms, provisional diagnosis, proposed procedure,) Tj
T*
(   estimated cost, expected length of stay and treating doctor authentication.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-4.2  Supporting clinical evidence) Tj
T*
(   Consultation note, investigation reports and emergency notes sufficient to assess) Tj
T*
(   necessity.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-4.3  Final authorization evidence) Tj
T*
(   At discharge the hospital submits final bill, discharge summary, procedure notes, implant) Tj
T*
(   details and any variance from the authorized treatment.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-4.4  Authorization is not final payment) Tj
T*
(   Approval is conditional on final diagnosis, actual treatment, active eligibility, policy) Tj
T*
(   terms and complete final records.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
