(6. DOCUMENT VALIDATION CHECKS) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Validation records facts; it does not invent missing values.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-6.1  Cross-document identity) Tj
T*
(   Compare patient name, age, sex, member ID and relationship across claim form, member) Tj
T*
(   record and clinical documents. Normalize harmless formatting differences.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-6.2  Date chronology) Tj
T*
(   Check consultation, admission, procedure, discharge, invoice and payment chronology.) Tj
T*
(   Impossible dates require clarification.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-6.3  Amount reconciliation) Tj
T*
(   Reconcile itemized bill, final bill, receipts, discounts, deposits and requested amount.) Tj
T*
(   Preserve currency and decimal values.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-6.4  Provider validation) Tj
T*
(   Verify provider name, address, registration and network status for the date of service.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-6.5  Clinical consistency) Tj
T*
(   Diagnosis, procedure, length of stay, prescriptions and investigations should be) Tj
T*
(   clinically coherent; inconsistencies require medical review.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
