(7. FILE AND DATA STANDARDS) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(These standards support reliable OCR and retrieval.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-7.1  Accepted files) Tj
T*
(   Searchable PDF is preferred. PDF scans, JPEG and PNG may be accepted through OCR when) Tj
T*
(   legible. Executables and untrusted archives are prohibited.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-7.2  Image quality) Tj
T*
(   Target at least 300 DPI, full-page capture, correct orientation, visible edges and no) Tj
T*
(   glare over monetary or clinical fields.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-7.3  Naming) Tj
T*
(   Recommended pattern is memberID_claimID_documentType_date_sequence, without diagnosis in) Tj
T*
(   externally visible filenames.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-7.4  Extraction confidence) Tj
T*
(   Low-confidence OCR fields, handwriting, altered documents and contradictory totals) Tj
T*
(   require human verification against the source image.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
