T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(This index points to the controlling checklist.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-8.1  Hospital reimbursement) Tj
T*
(   Use universal checklist CLM-2 and relevant conditional items CLM-3.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-8.2  Cashless hospitalization) Tj
T*
(   Use CLM-4 and the procedural rules in AIEHBP-NET-004.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-8.3  Pre/post hospitalization) Tj
T*
(   Provide accepted hospitalization reference, dated prescriptions, invoices, receipts and) Tj
T*
(   reports tying expenses to the same condition.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-8.4  Ambulance) Tj
T*
(   Provide transport invoice showing patient, date, origin, destination and emergency) Tj
T*
(   purpose.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CLM-8.5  Do not infer approval) Tj
T*
(   Document completeness means the file can be assessed; it does not establish coverage or) Tj
T*
(   payable amount.) Tj
T*
